  m_text: 'SAFE AREA - TRAINING REVIEW

    EXIT signs -> stairs -> playground. Wait
    for staff.

    Do not re-enter. Follow your school''s procedures.

    Reflect:
    Which EXIT cue helped? Why avoid the lift?

    Optional: choose ONE answer block
    for the box.

    Correct +20; wrong +0. One attempt per round.

    Practice
    cloth: +10 pickup / +20 return, once.

    60 seconds is a game setting, not
    a safety limit.'
